  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.2.0: the diagnostic message now shows the fully qualified method path (e.g. \"Argument 'x' in method 'Namespace.Type.Method' should be named\"); the .editorconfig options (OnlyForRecords, ExcludedMethodNames, UseDefaultExcludedMethods) are now correctly applied; fixed global:: prefix parsing for exclusion lists; added fully-qualified extension-method exclusion support and comprehensive analyzer/fixer tests; zero-warning build.",
